---
title: Pad See Ew
servings: 2
course: dinner
cuisine: Thai
tags: stir-fry, chicken, noodle
image: https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/uuuspp1468263334.jpg
source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ohy1DELF4is
---

Mix sauce (@dark soy sauce{2%tbsp}, @oyster sauce{2%tbsp}, @soy sauce{2%tsp}, @white distilled vinegar{2%tsp}, @sugar{2%tsp}, and @water{2%tbsp}) in small #bowl{}.

Mince @garlic{2%cloves} into #wok{} with @peanut oil{2%tbsp}. Place over high heat, when hot, add @chicken breast{250%g} and @chinese broccoli{200%g}(stems), cook until chicken is light golden.

Push to the side of the #wok{}, crack @egg{1} in and scramble. Don't worry if it sticks to the bottom of the wok - it will char and which adds authentic flavour.

Add @rice stick noodle{180%g}, the leaves of the @&chinese broccoli{} and sauce. Gently mix together until the noodles are stained dark and leaves are wilted. Serve immediately!
